{"id":"a3cbb9e789ffac00","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing-projection-map.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Projection Map","display":"df-zfc-forcing-projection-map — ZFC Forcing Projection Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-projection-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-projection-map","58-df-zfc-forcing11-projection-map","58-df-zfc-forcing8-projection-map"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-projection-map — ZFC Forcing Projection Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-projection-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-projection-map</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing11-projection-map</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing8-projection-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-projection-map — ZFC Forcing Projection Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\in V\">\\(\\pi,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingProjectionMap}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingProjectionMap}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}projection\\text{-}map} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingProjectionMap}_S\n(\\pi,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\land\n\\exists 1_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\exists 1_{\\mathbb Q}\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;(p\\leq_{\\mathbb P}1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\n\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(q\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}1_{\\mathbb Q})\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q)\\land\\pi(1_{\\mathbb P})=1_{\\mathbb Q}\\land\n\\forall p,r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\to\\pi(r)\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\pi(p))\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\n\\bigl(q\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\pi(p)\\to\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land\\pi(r)\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}q)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}projection\\text{-}map} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingProjectionMap}_S\n(\\pi,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\land\n\\exists 1_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\exists 1_{\\mathbb Q}\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;(p\\leq_{\\mathbb P}1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\n\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(q\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}1_{\\mathbb Q})\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q)\\land\\pi(1_{\\mathbb P})=1_{\\mathbb Q}\\land\n\\forall p,r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\to\\pi(r)\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\pi(p))\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\n\\bigl(q\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\pi(p)\\to\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land\\pi(r)\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}q)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The projection is a top-preserving monotone map with the forcing lifting property.</li>\n<li>Numbered projection-map variants are merged here; order-preserving variants are retained as alias predicates.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\pi,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingProjectionMap}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}projection\\text{-}map} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{ZfcForcingProjectionMap}_S\n(\\pi,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&\\quad\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\land\n\\exists 1_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\exists 1_{\\mathbb Q}\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;(p\\leq_{\\mathbb P}1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\n\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(q\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}1_{\\mathbb Q})\\land\\\\\n&\\quad\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q)\\land\\pi(1_{\\mathbb P})=1_{\\mathbb Q}\\land\n\\forall p,r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\to\\pi(r)\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\pi(p))\\land\\\\\n&\\quad\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\n\\bigl(q\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\pi(p)\\to\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land\\pi(r)\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}q)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1844,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1976","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing-projection-map.md|58-df-zfc-forcing-projection-map]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018","36d7463d215be751"]}